WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:00.973
- I want to ask you this,

00:00:00.973 --> 00:00:02.390
'cause you've done so much Broadway

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:04.430
that you've forgotten your lyrics.

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:05.790
I've heard that you
kind of did it on stage

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:07.578
and people think it's kind
of a fun thing with you.

00:00:07.578 --> 00:00:08.934
- Yeah, no, it's not.

00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:10.440
(audience laughs)

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.745
It's not a fun thing.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.080
- I'm bad at it.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.200
- It's a nightmare.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.760
- I know I'm bad at it too.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:16.920
Are you, how are you at it though?

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:21.080
'Cause here's my thing,
somehow I will say something,

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.270
it will somehow rhyme.

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:24.910
It won't make sense, but
it will somehow rhyme.

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:27.070
- So that's what you're taught to do.

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:30.430
What's interesting is I did not do that.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:35.430
I took the opposite approach
and forgot the human language,

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:40.350
forgot the entirety of
our experience vocally

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:42.428
as a collective species

00:00:42.428 --> 00:00:47.428
and just stopped talking
as the music was playing

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:50.073
very loudly, it gets worse.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:55.870
The stage manager was
screaming the line at me

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:59.420
going you're making things up again.

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:00.866
And all I heard was.

00:01:00.866 --> 00:01:02.673
(voice rings)

00:01:02.673 --> 00:01:03.510
- What?

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:05.510
- I had like tinnitus or something.

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:06.590
I was a living nightmare.

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:08.040
- Oh, you had a ringing?

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.100
- I had a ringing sensation.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:11.652
- I've had that happen once to me.

00:01:11.652 --> 00:01:15.810
- It was like energy up
above got bored that day

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:19.030
and was like, ooh, let's
play with Josh's life.

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:20.830
And it was like, this is insane.

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:25.340
And then my co-star was
screaming the line at me,

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:27.860
and I still couldn't say the line.

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:28.950
I couldn't hear anything.

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:30.620
And then can I curse on your show?

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:31.453
- We'll bleep it.

00:01:31.453 --> 00:01:32.360
- You'll bleep it out, good?

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:34.990
This is how I got out of it, okay,

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:36.080
live theater,

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:39.530
people paying $500 a ticket
to see Book of Mormon,

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:41.800
I looked out at my cast and said

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:43.964
what the (bleep)'s my next line?

00:01:43.964 --> 00:01:46.797
(audience laughs)

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:51.773
I am a trained professional.

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:54.725
Don't try that at home.

00:01:54.725 --> 00:01:57.410
- But you know what, if I'm at that show,

00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:59.420
best experience ever.

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:04.210
- But here's the worst
part, they were so confused,

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:05.950
they weren't even enjoying it.

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:10.330
They were just like, this is
a very weird part of this show

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:11.603
right now that's happening.

00:02:11.603 --> 00:02:13.650
Does this happen every night?

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:15.890
This script feels like it needs work.

00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:18.860
And from that point on, in Book of Mormon,

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.980
I actually in the song,

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:25.874
I had an actual Book of Mormon
where I pasted the lines

00:02:25.874 --> 00:02:28.890
so that when I opened
it up, I don't care now,

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:30.670
I did it 10 years ago, whatever,

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:32.920
whatever audience you
thought after the fact.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:33.849
(audience laughs)

00:02:33.849 --> 00:02:35.112
- That's clever.

00:02:35.112 --> 00:02:36.048
Spoiler alert.

00:02:36.048 --> 00:02:37.383
- Spoiler alert.

